      "comment": "Huixin: Ganyu",
      "content": "Huixin grew up on her father's tales of Ganyu and joined Yuehai Pavilion in order to be like her. When troubles at the pavilion made her doubt herself, she asked for no help, but Ganyu came anyway at Uncle Tian's request. At Xinyue Kiosk Huixin told her that she had been irreplaceable to them, and that she hoped Ganyu would guide her own daughter too.",
